{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 19, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thou shalt board a flight bound for the land of the rising sun, Japan. Upon arrival in the bustling metropolis of Tokyo, thou shalt embark upon a tour of the city's most renowned sights.\n\nFirst, thou shalt visit the Meiji Shrine, a tranquil and sacred place dedicated to the deified spirits of Emperor Meiji and his consort, Empress Shōken. Next, thou shalt stroll through the vibrant Harajuku district, where thou shalt bear witness to the latest trends in Japanese fashion. Then, thou shalt make thy way to the Shibuya Crossing, a bustling intersection where hundreds of pedestrians converge simultaneously.\n\nThe following day, thou shalt venture to the historic district of Asakusa, where thou shalt explore the Sensō-ji temple, Tokyo's oldest and most revered Buddhist temple. Afterwards, thou shalt take a cruise down the Sumida River, where thou shalt marvel at the city's iconic skyline.\n\nOn the third day of thy journey, thou shalt embark upon a day trip to Nikkō, a picturesque town nestled in the mountains north of Tokyo. Here, thou shalt visit the Toshogu Shrine, a stunning UNESCO World Heritage Site dedicated to the founder of the Tokugawa shogunate, Tokugawa Ieyasu.\n\nThe following day, thou shalt return to Tokyo and visit the Odaiba district, a man-made island filled with shopping and entertainment options. Here, thou shalt find the Palette Town Ferris wheel, which offers stunning views of the city and the bay.\n\nOn the fifth day, thou shalt venture to the historic city of Kyoto, where thou shalt explore the Fushimi Inari Shrine, a beautiful Shinto shrine known for its iconic red torii gates. Next, thou shalt visit the Kinkaku-ji temple, a stunning golden pavilion that reflects beautifully upon the surrounding lake.\n\nOn the sixth day, thou shalt visit the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, a serene and peaceful forest of towering bamboo stalks. Afterwards, thou shalt visit the Kiyomizu-dera temple, a stunning Buddhist temple perched precariously on a cliffside.\n\nOn the final day of thy journey, thou shalt visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park, a tranquil and moving tribute to the victims of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima. Here, thou shalt reflect upon the events of the past and consider the importance of peace and understanding in our world.\n\nAnd thus concludes thy itinerary for a journey through Japan, a land of ancient traditions, modern wonders, and unforgettable experiences. Go forth, and may the sun shine upon thy face, the wind carry thee to new heights, and the stars guide thee on thy path.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.308956116437912}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.021099278703331947}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.7590998411178589}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.018786242231726646}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.000590865034610033}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.020684484392404556}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0007656264933757484}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.12105988711118698}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -1.0132738680113107e-05}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.05172290280461311}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.2063574492931366}, {"token": "way", "logprob": -5.721882189391181e-05}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.00014161060971673578}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -3.290122185717337e-05}, {"token": "airport", "logprob": -0.03311667963862419}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0490659661591053}, {"token": "where", "logprob": -0.002848736010491848}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -1.0729825496673584}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.004576446954160929}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "board", "logprob": -0.008800648152828217}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -2.4676019165781327e